      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ بَعِضَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A land abounding with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَعُوض</span> [or
<i>gnats,</i> or <i>musquitoes</i>]; (K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبْعَضَةٌ</span></b> ,
like as you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبَقَّةٌ</span>. (TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْلَةٌ بَعِضَةٌ</span> <i>A
